('F-2026-10-07-CL41-F2-COMPATIBILITY-CLOSE','campaign.central-lodge.endgame',NULL,'CL-41 F2 existing four encounter observations certified preserved','CL-41 compatibility slice is source-certified: F2 still contains 8 Regions, 4 enabled existing observation RegionBehaviors, unchanged geometry SHA b2001545ca35276b6a34799945e55f03648e326bd119f2f741619d9e5f6e2eca, approved active ritual baseline flags, and an explicitly bound F1-to-F2 arrival. No novel ritual escalation, conventional gate, or gameplay canary installed; those remain later encounter authority and QA work.','campaign','static','locked','S-2026-10-07-CL41-COMPATIBILITY-CLOSE',NULL,'central lodge cl41 f2 compatibility preservation no canary'),
('F-2026-10-07-CL50-T3-F1-TRAVEL','campaign.central-lodge.routes',NULL,'CL-50 exact T3 ancient passage to F1 arrival installed','Read-only F1 and T3 authority check confirmed T3 ancient passage Region Tkg7XpsF7X1P3ZVJ and F1 arrival Region zKNU1R3JGIMMt017 with explicit t3-arrival stable ID. Guarded APPLY added GM-confirmed Scene travel behavior tSqhDN5CtAHzccmf, source SHA c179ae83855e6eb136a1225bfbb882ab9c6b7bcd3f0773df3654f82b2b23d6cb and bindingStatus BOUND_CL50_T3_TO_F1. Independent FINAL VERIFY PASS at 21 Scenes/202 Regions/114 behaviors with kernel, geometry and ledger state unmodified. No gameplay canary; this is one-way, no F1 return behavior.','campaign','full_function','locked','S-2026-10-07-CL50-T3-F1-TRAVEL',NULL,'central lodge cl50 t3 f1 bound gm confirmation'),
('F-2026-10-07-CL50-T3-N3-RETURN','campaign.central-lodge.routes',NULL,'CL-50 exact T3 N3 branch return bound','T3 N3 branch mouth Region YElrtisbXN3DJ2Sw already declared N3 as destination, and N3 Branch Railway Region RP1jYOH738xl9hks is the exact return anchor. Guarded APPLY created GM-confirmed return behavior pZpcYXFn517t6L5U, source SHA 051c669835aaed94f0497ebe6e54590d37df97eceb271b611b0263ca95b8f963, status BOUND_CL50_T3_RETURN_N3. Independent no-write FINAL VERIFY PASS at 21 Scenes/202 Regions/115 behaviors, ledger revision 0, N3 t3BranchUnlocked remains false. N3-to-T3 automatic unlock and live canary remain deferred.','campaign','full_function','locked','S-2026-10-07-CL50-T3-N3-RETURN',NULL,'central lodge cl50 t3 n3 return no branch unlock');
