('D-453','CL-41 F2 compatibility slice preserves authored encounter','Mark F2 compatibility source-audit complete without inventing additional ritual escalation or conventional puzzle locks. The four legacy observers, F1 arrival, baseline ritual state and geometry remain unchanged. Encounter escalation and gameplay canary must be separately designed and tested.','Existing campaign source explicitly defines F2 as living cult plus incoming Fiend Machine with encounter-owned state; no authored new puzzle solution was provided.','campaign','locked','Foreman','S-2026-10-07-CL41-COMPATIBILITY-CLOSE',NULL),
('D-454','CL-50 safe two-exit T3 travel binder','Bind T3 ancient passage mouth to explicitly authored F1 t3-arrival, and bind T3 N3 branch mouth return to explicitly identified N3 Branch Railway, using primary-GM-only confirmation and no forced teleport. Defer all T1/T2 mouth orientation guesses, F1 return, N3-to-T3 unlock, rail-car fast travel, and game canary until authority is proven.','Live metadata gives exact F1 and N3 destination Regions; T1/T2 mouth orientations and N3 t3BranchUnlocked conditions remain uncertain. One-way confirmed T3 exits avoid automatic bounce loops.','campaign','locked','Foreman','S-2026-10-07-CL50-T3-F1-TRAVEL',NULL);
